# CODEOWNERS — Navdhya review routing
# Maps paths to the engineer (or team) that owns that area.
# GitHub will auto-assign reviewers and require their approval before merge
# on protected branches once the rule-set is enabled in repo settings.
#
# Engineers (see planning-04june.md §VI Part VI):
#   @eng-a: auth, security, finops, ops
#   @eng-b: dashboards, UX, content
#   @eng-c: directory, AI/search, i18n, infra
#   @platform-lead: cross-cutting decisions, governance, ADRs

# Default — anyone on the team can review small changes
*                                       @eng-a @eng-b @eng-c

